       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID: ORD-0001): amlodipine 50 mg by mouth once daily.\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the usual maximum of 10 mg/day and that you confirmed it is intentional. It also recommends pharmacy verification and close monitoring.\n\nBecause of the dose, I'd suggest:\n- Frequent BP and heart rate checks, especially in the first 24\u201348 hours.\n- Watching for hypotension, reflex tachycardia, and peripheral edema.\n- Telling nursing about the dose so they can hold it and call you for symptomatic hypotension.\n- Expecting pharmacy to call about the dose, since it will likely trigger a verification alert."
